  "project_description": "This simple module allows you to change the theme of a page with just a query string, using Theme Negotiator.\n\n How to change the page theme: \n\n \n Install Theme Selector module using composer and enable it. \n Go to /admin/config/user-interface/theme-selector and add a Theme Selector. \n Select the Theme and the associated sufix. \n Using the query string ?theme-selector you'll be able to change the page theme. \n \n Example: \n\n https://example.com?theme-selector=bartik \n\n Important note: Since this module uses a query parameter page cache is going to be disabled",
